    "regime_notes": "5-day predictive power is above the benchmark admission IC and ICIR gates, but decay is rapid and the 2026 calendar regime was strongly negative (-0.1703); 2027 +0.0259, 2028 +0.0279, 2029 -0.0010, 2030 +0.0015, 2031 YTD +0.0965. The 15-asset cross-section implies conservative uncertainty interpretation.",
